{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>基層家庭「上樓捷徑」特快公屋編配計劃周三起（9月2日）揀樓，房屋署今日最新名單，1,268伙中有1,255伙為二人或以上單位，194伙涉及自殺或意外身故，另有三伙曾發生兇殺案，分別位於慈樂邨、順天邨、翠林邨。</p><figure><img alt=\"特快公屋編配計劃周三（2日）揀樓，據房屋署公布的二人或以上獨立單位最新名單，今年1,268伙中，有三個為凶宅。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240912/910883969111691264486721.jpeg/20aJQKVbxemESkIR9xkjh9wKqkHGfbSidkng03ZJ4NM\"/><figcaption>特快公屋編配計劃周三（2日）揀樓，據房屋署公布的二人或以上獨立單位最新名單，今年1,268伙中，有三個為凶宅。</figcaption></figure><p>▼特快公屋　可供揀選單位（獨立單位）名單▼</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159018714959872307419.jpeg/g-Lt5dgGDl_83LLhbhHv2i3bI81kdAOUrjsXm647F5s\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159021525274624174025.jpeg/5Yx8CdNQhYZVme9VfZMgP0aEnEisYf0c2OBM9NjgTPQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159024180400128524360.jpeg/0qlzb1z8TIfEIjsgQBomY8Y_tjns1BWtOnOF1TpzhdU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159026554507264491570.jpeg/SMjfi7NDFZcOwh96fwu8fA1uAZVvCs40mxYVU5sWFVM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159029259964416365402.jpeg/4Wv2ddIJIDEERxqOvbZYJCs0dmzv-AiTkHl5A5B5eQM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159018832400384052479.jpeg/owMwXmfjDUcjYis5H5rVl9G5nyia1V3WktqyDJLasgw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159021529468928690381.jpeg/mHnwDVVy_YmcDvawmesb-TSil-tJXs2OyaUwhsmlMIY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159025241559040345829.jpeg/_ScWJQSOSVb78Q5PJfVQBKDHF_EQRvVuqrCpHqqwqR4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159028118982656496837.jpeg/mUcOEfNdUSKcCUrBDu_OiMX9TyZcCm2TJYLqpSWC6qU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159030723776512821079.jpeg/DUVOsym6oFGbPet-69j7Q8nuHcAg5XL-fy2_VH8tv1Q\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171159017901264896708351.jpeg/HDpmMsx0ChDij3m_0L7Jl7zMt0Dh1RkWAItUIgCLVCI\"/><img src=